Mori (Codebase Memory MCP)
Original project: https://github.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp
Original author: DeusData, as named in LICENSE. The design is described in
Vogel, Meyer-Eschenbach, Kohler, Grünewald and Balzer, "Codebase-Memory:
Tree-Sitter-Based Knowledge Graphs for LLM Code Exploration via MCP",
arXiv:2603.27277.

Imported into Unique-Divine/jiyuu through the fork
https://github.com/Unique-Divine/codebase-memory-mcp from commit
cdfdf26483fa56f4f7d9d85e7c4c3924133b458b without Git history.
Modified by Unique Divine in 2026. Changes include fetching the vendored
Tree-sitter grammars at build time from a sha256-pinned archive instead of
committing them, removing upstream CI and package-publishing wrappers, test
adjustments for those removals, build recipes and documentation.

